Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.93,0:02:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what she meant\Nby physically demanding?
Dialogue: 11,0:02:03.95,0:02:07.91,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,524)\bord0\blur0.6\shad0\\c&H000000&\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1814.4,906.4)}Blitz, Sahara, Twinkle
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.95,0:02:07.91,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,524)\bord2\blur3\shad0\\c&H000000&\4c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1817.4,909.4)}Blitz, Sahara, Twinkle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.27,0:02:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are really starting to heat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming up next in round two, we have\NShushu Tsuruka of the Seven Squadron!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.51,0:02:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Versus the Hata Wakata of the Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both competitors specialize\Nin hand-to-hand combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling this is\Ngonna be an entire battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch this, Yukki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to clobber her! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.79,0:02:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then maybe you'll show\Nme some appreciation after?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.28,0:02:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Yachiho.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.55,0:02:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you lost your match,\Nyou get to be our cheerleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Sahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we both like close combat, why don't\Nwe hold off on our abilities until later?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, set, let the battle begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sahara starts off with a gracious kick,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Shushu grabs her by\Nthe leg and slams her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She follows it up with a yellow drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.59,0:03:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sahara grabs Shushu from behind
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And hits her with a German suplex!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.85,0:03:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break out the abilities!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.77,0:03:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just starting to get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, you're gonna get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What number do you think she'll do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one or maybe two?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.73,0:03:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would guess three or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of their abilities center\Naround physical strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll be a short match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paradigm Shift!
