Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On three!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paper Beats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win rock-paper-scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You totally cheated!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sahara unleashed her\Nawesome Crazy Shape ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It allows her to boost\Nher strength for the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,precise amount of time\Nshe sets in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One minute minimum, 60 maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shorter the time allotted,\Nthe stronger she gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, her ability has a mandatory\Nthree minute cool down period.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice move, keep it up, Sahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sign is impressive, but it\Nmakes you easy to dodge! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.69,0:05:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it makes you an easy target!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukki, you don't have\Nto give me that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are you ready to give up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only begun to show you what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.47,0:05:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, you've really got guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weird to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.41,0:05:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I so determined?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Shushu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having a boyfriend is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you sound like a broken record.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't get why\Nyou're so opposed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.73,0:05:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's never a dull moment with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And seeing that look of joy on his face,\Nit's the best feeling in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's rare to find a girl\Nso devoted to her man nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.11,0:06:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so old-fashioned.
