Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about\Njoining these guys lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I went to Mato, I\Nbet I'd never get bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single day would be a total blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very on-brand. Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I guess you just don't\Nunderstand what I'm going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll get it one of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.17,0:06:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, keep your eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm about to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.97,0:06:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you'd have an easier\Ntime moving around if you were smaller?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important to assess the situation\Nand tailor your ability accordingly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think smaller is better?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of self-control\Nis a snooze-fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I live by one motto, go\Nbig or go home. Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's paradigm shift!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:07:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll push the envelope and crush you!
