Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see that coming. And... Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too big for you to dodge, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.73,0:07:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ref, can you see\Nif she's unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Shushu won her match! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She got back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's part of Sahara's ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she loses consciousness\Nwhile her skill is active,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her heightened killer\Ninstinct takes control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and will continue to fight on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll attack enemies and allies alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it only makes her\Nthat much more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sahara can sleep anytime, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That happens to be her secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.35,0:08:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winner is Sahara Wakasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:09:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because of my incredible\Ncheerleading skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She took her down in three minutes, Vlad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.93,0:09:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.71,0:09:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got her all patched up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your shirt ripped!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sahara, get the hell off me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must've...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, take this! Shushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for losing my match.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost had her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will discuss where\Nyou can improve later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.71,0:09:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you better go get changed. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I looked like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Yukki saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, do you want anything to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can grab it for you\Nwhile you get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.77,0:10:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I\Ncan do, just let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the caretaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you take care of my memories and\Nerase that pitiful excuse for a match?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it sucks you didn't win, but\NI don't think it was pitiful at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be perfectly honest, I wanted to see\Nmore of the wrestling you did at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would have if she\Nhadn't been a buzzkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.23,0:11:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be fair, I did tell\Nyou to close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but why the hell did you kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured I would chase the shock\Nof losing with an even bigger shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the power move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell him how I feel\Nuntil I get him to like me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any anomalies in Mato? Nei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing out of the...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.89,0:12:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.89,0:12:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.69,0:12:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.75,0:12:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only just broke our cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the others I said hi, and\Nthat the battle begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.39,0:12:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shuuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the world are they coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My barrier is impenetrable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This flimsy thing is a barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A humanoid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Rairen and this absurdity\Nfills me with laughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing cracked my barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're calling off the exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of pests.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time you went extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a dying breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All hands prepare for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenka! I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take the non-combatants to the dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.81,0:13:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And have Nei give you her recon report!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy every last Shuuki! Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this one on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you fight? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paradigm Shift!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my boot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm already feeling as good as new!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.05,0:14:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let up on the crowd control!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cover your six!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not them. You're going somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.07,0:14:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not you either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But perhaps I'll burn you down to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be a tough one to crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just now, you stepped in because you knew\Nthe lightning was coming ahead of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.21,0:15:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.11,0:15:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me ride on Yuki's\Nback with you! With her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two people at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we've never tried that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.05,0:15:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, get on! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Himari. The three of us. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.63,0:15:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a gut feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that with two masters,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.91,0:15:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll take on a more powerful form.
