Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.61,0:16:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to use new powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give them hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.17,0:16:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power is coursing through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet I could do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that move she did back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.87,0:16:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use the same method as\NBrand Break to channel my energy!
Dialogue: 11,0:16:28.64,0:16:30.06,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs150\c&HE7E9E9&\pos(483.48,849.28)}HOWLING
