Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.87,0:16:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what two can do! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can annihilate\Nthe Swarm in one blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about Yachiho?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.63,0:16:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sixth squadron is in great hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got Tenka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.49,0:16:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still two more humanoids?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see them now, but I'm sure. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.09,0:16:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.31,0:16:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you outshine me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll give them something\Nbetter than an exhibition match.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.89,0:17:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll give them a Commander Showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Torture!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Ted and Lady Kyo are out\Nthere fighting and I'm stuck here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because the dorm has\Nthe sturdiest barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.05,0:17:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can barely see from\Nso far away, it's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to watch their\Nmagnificent applause!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.19,0:17:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you put your hand on Nae's shoulder,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she can link with your mind\Nso you can watch the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.15,0:17:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okawamura, you're the\Nbest! Yay! I can see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to fall down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:17:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shuki can't be beaten with normal weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of Mato granted by the Peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And specially made weapons\Nimbued with the Peaches' power?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are the only ways to counter them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the exception of that is Lady Kyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyouka Uzen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She trained to top a\Nsacred mountain to perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her own unique style of\Ncombat that destroys Shuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She gained the skills needed to defeat\Nthem without relying on her Peach ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.11,0:18:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this exceptional nature of hers is\Nhow she landed her position as commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I get to\Nsee Lady Kyo's strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream come true for a fan like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Kyo's ability is stronger than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is totally wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.37,0:18:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden Hour!
