Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.81,0:19:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a persistent\Nlittle pest, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.49,0:19:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body's all warmed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll obliterate you with the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.51,0:20:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nicely done, Yachiho.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.67,0:20:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did she come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.85,0:20:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's swap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go take it easy for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my entire army's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.41,0:20:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What army's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already neutralized any Shuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.81,0:21:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That might interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reports reveal the existence of\Ntwo more officer-level humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I would like to\Nstart by eliminating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This power
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.87,0:21:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like I'm gonna get\Nto have a little fun tonight?
